uplink-chemlab-crate-name = Portable Chemistry Lab
uplink-chemlab-crate-desc = This crate contains a bit of everything needed to go breaking bad. Includes vials of elements, machine flatpacks, and sterile clothing. Power not included.

uplink-gibdart-name = Gib-dart
uplink-gibdart-desc = A seemingly unremarkable dart with a single drop of explosive poison, refined by the greatest NT chemists. You have one shot at this.

uplink-vestine-vial-name = Small Vial of Vestine
uplink-vestine-vial-desc = Stolen from a CyberSun hauler, this vial contains 15 units of Vestine. Goes well with the chemistry lab.
